# Exponential Desktop's factory sidebar (#EDE-44, #EDE-65): the IDE's icon rail for good, a 56 px top
# layer surface on the left edge, black like the IDE's (the IDE's ground: no Sidebar fill), standing
# on the taskbar (the taskbar spans the bottom edge and holds the start, chat and new-issue buttons).
# No 272 px column, no rail toggle, no workspaces, search, inbox, Needs you or team switcher here (the
# start menu holds the switcher and Settings). It lists only the chats, flattened, most recent first:
# /shell/chats [{id, title, glyph}] from uicore-model's chatRows (packages/uicore/fixtures/shell.json
# `chats`): the current team's or Local desktop's root sessions, each the agent's mark as in the IDE's
# rail (`agent:claude`, `agent:codex`, with THE count badge as `ide:badge:count:<tone>:<label>|<glyph>`,
# else its working dot as `ide:badge:dot:green|<glyph>`); a press opens the chat (ede_chat {sessionId}: eDE's chat on that
# session, on a Local desktop and on a team alike; the Exponential app's session
# (exponential://session/<id>) only when the team's chat cannot open it). The IDE mounts this document
# too (#EXP-1725): its rail and column are the shared nodes (the header (the brand, search and new;
# the switcher keeps Local desktops), the ide_* sections it fills from /shell/ide
# (packages/uicore/fixtures/ide-sidebar.express; ide_prs = #EXP-1616's Pull requests tree of the team's
# Exponential repositories, a List{divided:false} like the other sections, the IDE fills with Rows
# {depth, identifier #n, title, subtitle head → base} from /shell/ide/prs (a Row's depth never binds:
# the tree guides are computed from its siblings), a press opening the repo's page; it hides while
# /shell/ide/prs is empty), and the corner, the IDE's footer at the sidebar's bottom under the
# scrolling rows: the member's account (the avatar `/shell/ide/me`, the first name
# `/shell/ide/meName`, the switcher chevron; its Menu = web's account menu: What's new, About, Sign
# out = ide_account {value}), the Computer button (Terminal, Files, Source control, Version history,
# the trunk's failure badge) and Settings (the personal settings, settings-nav.json
# `desktopNavs.personal`), #EXP-1741; the IDE mounts the corner on its own below its Getting started
# entry); eDE prunes those it does not draw (the header, ide_nav, the corner) and never feeds
# /shell/ide, and the IDE prunes `chats`. #EXP-2027 (domain-contract sidebar-tree.json,
# ide-sidebar.express): no active team. ide_nav = Home, Needs you, Chats, Drafts. ide_devices = a List
# over /shell/ide/devices: the Devices row (its press = ide_devices {action: fold}; its hover + =
# ide_add {kind: device}; the fold glyph) and one Row per device at depth 1 (muted ones inside an
# opacity Box; a shared one wears its team's mark on its glyph, the IDE paints it; trailing the green
# online dot, the hover gear = ide_gear {kind: device}; a press = ide_open {kind:
# device}). ide_teams = the Teams label (its + Menu: New team, Join team = ide_switcher {value}) and
# ONE reorderable List (ide_tree_list over /shell/ide/tree, maxDepth 3, key id, its move = ide_move
# with the List's {id, before|after|into} as payload) holding every team's rows and, after them, the
# Active band (its label row `active-head` and one row per running chat, key `active:<root>`, so an
# Active row drags INTO a team: sidebarDropSession; every row carries `team`): the team Row
# (a right-click opens the team Menu: New › /newItems, New folder, Settings = ide_team {id} with
# {value}; #EXP-2109, header-actions.json rows.team: its hover + = THE New list (the owner's or the
# member's Menu, by /owner) then its hover … = the team Menu without New; a press = ide_team
# {action: fold}), the folder Row at depth 1 (a right-click
# Menu: Rename, Ungroup = ide_folder {section: team, team, id} with {value}; a press folds it; the
# count badge (the rows it hides) and the item count while folded), the folder's name Input in place (Enter or leaving it saves = ide_folder
# {action: save | leave}, Esc keeps the name), an item Row at depth 1 or 2 (a press = ide_open {kind:
# item}, the hover gear = ide_gear {kind: item}); a session item's right-click Menu holds Remove from
# sidebar (ide_session {team, id} with {value: remove}). An Active row (kind active) opens its chat
# (ide_open {kind: active, id: its root}) and wears its team's mark on its glyph. The host functions: ede_chat,
# ede_start_menu, ede_launch, ede_switcher. #EXP-2124 (domain-contract sidebar-menus.json): ide_nav
# opens with the viewer's Assistant (id assistant: its name, the brand mark the IDE paints, its count;
# a press opens its chat) and EVERY row has a right-click Menu (openOn contextmenu) whose items are its
# kind's row of THE table, spelled out here and written again by the IDE from domain::sidebar_menus (a
# test holds them equal): one Menu per row kind and viewer variant (a row's `menu`: device-mine |
# device-other, board-owner | board, agent-owner | agent, app, session, active-delete | active, each -placed once the chat sits in its team's list: no Add to sidebar, a verb
# with no action is never drawn; the nav
# rows by id), each wrapping its own copy of the row, every pick = ide_menu {kind, id, team} with
# {value}; New › binds the team row's `newItems` (THE New list), Move to folder › an item row's
# `moveItems` (the team's folders as folder:<id>, New folder, Top level inside a folder). A device's
# Rename puts its name in an Input in place (ide_device {id, action: save | leave}).
# ide_getting_started is the Getting started row under the scrolling rows (while
# /shell/ide/gettingStarted); the account row's right-click opens its own click menu
# (ide_account_context).
surface("sidebar", extensions={ede: {layer: "top", anchor: ["top", "left", "bottom"], size: {width: 56}, exclusiveZone: 56, keyboard: "on-demand", functions: ["ede_rail", "ede_start_menu", "ede_chat", "ede_launch", "ede_switcher"]}})
$/shell/chats = []
$/shell/rail = true
$/shell/switcher/connection/account = ""
$/shell/switcher/connection/connected = false
$/shell/switcher/connection/onLocal = true
$/shell/switcher/current/id = "local"
$/shell/switcher/current/kind = "local"
$/shell/switcher/current/name = "Local"
$/shell/switcher/entries = [{kind: "local", id: "local", name: "Local", current: true}]
root = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", height: "100%", paddingTop: "$spacing.sm", paddingBottom: "$spacing.sm", paddingLeft: "$spacing.xs", paddingRight: "$spacing.xs", backgroundColor: "$color.background"}, children=[sidebar])
sidebar = Sidebar(width=264, collapseBelow="never", collapsed=$/shell/rail, rail=true, children=[], slots={sidebar: "column"}, style={flexGrow: 1, minHeight: 0})
column = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xs", flexGrow: 1, minHeight: 0}, children=[header, switcher_menu, ide_nav, scroll, ide_getting_started, corner])
header = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=[switcher, ide_inbox, search, new])
switcher = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: "$spacing.sm", height: 40, paddingLeft: "$spacing.xs", paddingRight: "$spacing.xs", borderRadius: "$radius.md", flexGrow: 1, minWidth: 0}, pressable=true, children=[ide_switcher_mark, switcher_name, ide_switcher_chevron])
ide_switcher_mark = Icon(name=$/shell/ide/teamMark, style={width: 28, height: 28}, visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/teamMark, then=true, else=false))
switcher_name = Text(text=$/shell/switcher/current/name, variant="label", lines=1)
ide_switcher_chevron = Icon(name=$/shell/ide/chevron, size="sm", tone="neutral", visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/chevron, then=true, else=false))
ide_inbox = Icon(name=$/shell/ide/inbox, style={width: 32, height: 32}, visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/inbox, then=true, else=false))
search = Button(label="Search", icon="nav-search", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_start_menu(toggle=true)})
new = Button(label="New issue", icon="nav-create-issue", variant="default", size="icon", on={press: ede_launch(app="at.exponential")}, visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/ide/noBoard, then=true, else=false)))
switcher_menu = Popover(side="bottom", align="start", anchor=switcher, children=[switcher_list])
switcher_list = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xxs", width: 240, padding: "$spacing.xs"}, children=[switcher_sections, switcher_section, switcher_sep, switcher_connect, ide_switcher_new_team, ide_switcher_join])
switcher_sections = List(gap="xs", children=_template($/shell/switcher/sections, switcher_section, key="id"))
switcher_section = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xxs"}, children=[switcher_section_label, switcher_entries, switcher_entry])
switcher_section_label = Text(text=$label, variant="caption", lines=1)
switcher_entries = List(gap="none", children=_template($entries, switcher_entry, key="id"))
switcher_entry = Row(title=$name, selected=$current, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={leading: "switcher_entry_avatar", trailing: "ide_switcher_entry_dot"}, on={press: ede_switcher(account=$account, action="pick", id=$id, kind=$kind)})
switcher_entry_avatar = Avatar(name=$name, size="sm")
ide_switcher_entry_dot = Icon(name=$dotIcon, size="sm", visible=cond(if=$dotIcon, then=true, else=false))
switcher_sep = Separator()
switcher_connect = Row(title="Connect Exponential", icon="brand-exponential", density="compact", pressable=true, on={press: ede_switcher(action="connect")}, visible=not(value=or(values=[cond(if=$/shell/switcher/connection/connected, then=true, else=false), cond(if=$/shell/ide/signedIn, then=true, else=false)])))
ide_switcher_new_team = Row(title="New team", icon="ui-add", density="compact", pressable=true, on={press: Event("ide_switcher", {action: "new_team"})}, visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/signedIn, then=true, else=false))
ide_switcher_join = Row(title="Join team", icon="ui-invite", density="compact", pressable=true, on={press: Event("ide_switcher", {action: "join_team"})}, visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/signedIn, then=true, else=false))
ide_nav = List(gap="none", children=_template($/shell/ide/nav, ide_nav_node, key="id"), visible=not(value=eq(a=len(value=$/shell/ide/nav), b=0)))
ide_nav_node = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column"}, children=[ide_nav_assistant_menu, ide_nav_compose_menu, ide_nav_page_menu])
ide_nav_assistant_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Compact conversation", value: "compact", icon: "coding-compact"}, {label: "New conversation", value: "new-conversation", icon: "action-chat"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_nav_assistant_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: $id, id: $id})}, visible=eq(a=$id, b="assistant"))
ide_nav_assistant_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={trailing: "ide_nav_assistant_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "nav", id: $id})})
ide_nav_assistant_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_nav_assistant_dot], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_nav_assistant_dot = Icon(name=$dotIcon, size="sm", visible=cond(if=$dotIcon, then=true, else=false))
ide_nav_compose_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "New chat", value: "new-chat", icon: "action-chat", shortcut: "Alt+T"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_nav_compose_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: $id, id: $id})}, visible=or(values=[eq(a=$id, b="home"), eq(a=$id, b="chats")]))
ide_nav_compose_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={trailing: "ide_nav_compose_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "nav", id: $id})})
ide_nav_compose_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_nav_compose_dot], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_nav_compose_dot = Icon(name=$dotIcon, size="sm", visible=cond(if=$dotIcon, then=true, else=false))
ide_nav_page_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_nav_page_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: $id, id: $id})}, visible=or(values=[eq(a=$id, b="needs-you"), eq(a=$id, b="drafts")]))
ide_nav_page_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={trailing: "ide_nav_page_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "nav", id: $id})})
ide_nav_page_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_nav_page_dot], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_nav_page_dot = Icon(name=$dotIcon, size="sm", visible=cond(if=$dotIcon, then=true, else=false))
scroll = ScrollArea(style={flexGrow: 1, minHeight: 0}, children=[sections])
sections = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.sm"}, children=[chats, ide_tree, ide_prs])
chats = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xxs"}, children=[chats_list], visible=not(value=eq(a=len(value=$/shell/chats), b=0)))
chats_list = List(gap="none", children=_template($/shell/chats, chat_row, key="id"))
chat_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$glyph, density="compact", pressable=true, on={press: ede_chat(sessionId=$id)})
ide_tree = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.sm"}, children=[ide_devices, ide_teams])
ide_devices = List(gap="none", children=_template($/shell/ide/devices, ide_device_node, key="id"), visible=not(value=eq(a=len(value=$/shell/ide/devices), b=0)))
ide_device_node = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column"}, children=[ide_devices_menu, ide_device_mine_menu, ide_device_other_menu, ide_device_mine_muted_dim, ide_device_other_muted_dim, ide_device_edit])
ide_devices_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Add device", value: "add-device", icon: "ui-add"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_devices_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "devices", id: "devices"})}, visible=eq(a=$kind, b="devices"))
ide_devices_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={trailing: "ide_devices_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_devices", {action: "fold"})})
ide_devices_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", align="center", children=[ide_device_add, ide_devices_fold], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_device_add = Button(label="Add device", icon="ui-add", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("ide_add", {kind: "device"})}, style={width: 20, height: 20}, visible=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))
ide_devices_fold = Icon(name=$foldIcon, size="sm", tone="neutral")
ide_device_mine_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Rename", value: "rename", icon: "ui-edit"}, {label: "Copy link", value: "copy-link", icon: "ui-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_device_mine_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, visible=and(values=[eq(a=$kind, b="device"), eq(a=$menu, b="device-mine"), not(value=cond(if=$editing, then=true, else=false)), not(value=cond(if=$muted, then=true, else=false))]))
ide_device_mine_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, depth=1, slots={trailing: "ide_device_mine_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_mine_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_device_mine_mark, ide_device_mine_gear], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_device_mine_mark = Icon(name=$mark, size="sm", visible=and(values=[cond(if=$mark, then=true, else=false), not(value=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))]))
ide_device_mine_gear = Button(label="Device settings", icon="nav-settings", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("ide_gear", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, style={width: 20, height: 20}, visible=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))
ide_device_other_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Copy link", value: "copy-link", icon: "ui-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_device_other_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, visible=and(values=[eq(a=$kind, b="device"), eq(a=$menu, b="device-other"), not(value=cond(if=$editing, then=true, else=false)), not(value=cond(if=$muted, then=true, else=false))]))
ide_device_other_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, depth=1, slots={trailing: "ide_device_other_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_other_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_device_other_gear], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_device_other_gear = Button(label="Device settings", icon="nav-settings", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("ide_gear", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, style={width: 20, height: 20}, visible=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))
ide_device_mine_muted_dim = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", opacity: 0.5}, children=[ide_device_mine_muted_menu], visible=and(values=[eq(a=$kind, b="device"), eq(a=$menu, b="device-mine"), not(value=cond(if=$editing, then=true, else=false)), cond(if=$muted, then=true, else=false)]))
ide_device_mine_muted_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Rename", value: "rename", icon: "ui-edit"}, {label: "Copy link", value: "copy-link", icon: "ui-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_device_mine_muted_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_mine_muted_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, depth=1, slots={trailing: "ide_device_mine_muted_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_mine_muted_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_device_mine_muted_mark, ide_device_mine_muted_gear], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_device_mine_muted_mark = Icon(name=$mark, size="sm", visible=and(values=[cond(if=$mark, then=true, else=false), not(value=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))]))
ide_device_mine_muted_gear = Button(label="Device settings", icon="nav-settings", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("ide_gear", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, style={width: 20, height: 20}, visible=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))
ide_device_other_muted_dim = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", opacity: 0.5}, children=[ide_device_other_muted_menu], visible=and(values=[eq(a=$kind, b="device"), eq(a=$menu, b="device-other"), not(value=cond(if=$editing, then=true, else=false)), cond(if=$muted, then=true, else=false)]))
ide_device_other_muted_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "Open", value: "open", icon: "ui-arrow-right"}, {label: "Open in new tab", value: "open-new-tab", icon: "ui-external-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Copy link", value: "copy-link", icon: "ui-link"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_device_other_muted_row], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_other_muted_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, selected=$selected, density="compact", pressable=true, depth=1, slots={trailing: "ide_device_other_muted_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_open", {kind: "device", id: $id})})
ide_device_other_muted_trailing = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="none", align="center", children=[ide_device_other_muted_gear], visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_device_other_muted_gear = Button(label="Device settings", icon="nav-settings", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: Event("ide_gear", {kind: "device", id: $id})}, style={width: 20, height: 20}, visible=cond(if=$hover, then=true, else=false))
ide_device_edit = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: "$spacing.sm", minHeight: "$control.rowCompact", paddingLeft: "$spacing.xl", paddingRight: "$spacing.md", borderRadius: "$radius.md"}, children=[ide_device_edit_icon, ide_device_name], visible=and(values=[eq(a=$kind, b="device"), cond(if=$editing, then=true, else=false)]))
ide_device_edit_icon = Icon(name=$icon, size="sm")
ide_device_name = Input(label="Device name", name="deviceName", value=$title, variant="box", size="sm", on={submit: Event("ide_device", {id: $id, action: "save"}), blur: Event("ide_device", {id: $id, action: "leave"})}, style={flexGrow: 1, minWidth: 0})
ide_teams = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xxs"}, children=[ide_teams_head_menu, ide_tree_list], visible=cond(if=$/shell/ide/signedIn, then=true, else=false))
ide_teams_head_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "New team", value: "new-team", icon: "ui-add"}, {label: "Join team", value: "join-team", icon: "ui-invite"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_teams_head], on={select: Event("ide_menu", {kind: "teams", id: "teams"})}, visible=not(value=cond(if=$/shell/rail, then=true, else=false)))
ide_teams_head = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 24, paddingLeft: "$spacing.xs"}, children=[ide_teams_label, ide_teams_menu])
ide_teams_label = Text(text="Teams", variant="caption", style={flexGrow: 1, color: "$color.mutedForeground"})
ide_teams_menu = Menu(items=[{label: "New team", value: "new_team", icon: "ui-add"}, {label: "Join team", value: "join_team", icon: "ui-invite"}], side="bottom", align="start", children=[ide_teams_add], on={select: Event("ide_switcher", {})})
ide_teams_add = Button(label="Teams", icon="ui-add", variant="ghost", size="icon", style={width: 20, height: 20})
ide_tree_list = List(gap="none", reorderable=true, maxDepth=3, children=_template($/shell/ide/tree, ide_tree_node, key="id"), on={move: Event("ide_move", {})})
ide_tree_node = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column"}, children=[ide_team_menu, ide_folder_menu, ide_folder_edit, ide_board_owner_menu, ide_board_menu, ide_app_menu, ide_agent_owner_menu, ide_agent_menu, ide_session_menu, ide_board_owner_child_menu, ide_board_child_menu, ide_app_child_menu, ide_agent_owner_child_menu, ide_agent_child_menu, ide_session_child_menu, ide_active_head, ide_active_delete_menu, ide_active_keep_menu, ide_active_delete_placed_menu, ide_active_keep_placed_menu])
ide_team_menu = Menu(items=[{kind: "submenu", label: "New", icon: "ui-add", items: $newItems}, {label: "New folder", value: "new-folder", icon: "ui-folder"}, {kind: "separator"}, {label: "Settings", value: "settings", icon: "nav-settings"}], side="bottom", align="start", openOn="contextmenu", children=[ide_team_row], on={select: Event("ide_team", {id: $id})}, visible=eq(a=$kind, b="team"))
ide_team_row = Row(title=$title, icon=$icon, density="compact", pressable=true, slots={trailing: "ide_team_trailing"}, on={press: Event("ide_team", {action: "fold", id: $id})})
